  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 103.58 Permit action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 103.58 “Permit action” means an action initiated by the department to suspend, revoke, or modify a permit or other approval issued under RSA 482-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 103.56)",
